      <div type="layout" source="#source-16053-16660" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-16088-16622"><seg source="#source-16088-16097">織笠（</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-16097-16175"><seg source="#source-16127-16139">をりかさ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-16175-16178">）</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-16178-16259"><seg source="#source-16208-16223">陸中東閉伊</seg></seg><seg source="#source-16259-16280">　　　織島里（</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-16280-16364"><seg source="#source-16310-16328">おりじまがり</seg></seg><seg source="#source-16364-16367">）</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-16367-16445"><seg source="#source-16397-16409">肥前小城</seg></seg><seg source="#source-16445-16463">　　　織豊（</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-16463-16541"><seg source="#source-16493-16505">おりとよ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-16541-16544">）</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-16544-16622"><seg source="#source-16574-16586">尾張愛知</seg></seg></p>
